# Environment files
# `.env` is Lovable-managed and holds ONLY public, publishable Supabase client
# config (URL, project id, publishable key). It stays tracked so Lovable builds
# keep working. Never add server secrets to it — server secrets belong in the
# Lovable/Supabase secret store. Every other .env variant is ignored.
.env.*
!.env.example
.env.local
.env.*.local
*.pem
*.key
